cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the archived QAIFE software
  release. The citation of the related journal article will be added
  after publication.
title: "QAIFE Medical Image Classification"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.xxxxxxx"
date-released: "2026-09-20"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/vanbabenk/QAIFE-Medical-Image-Classification"
abstract: >-
  QAIFE is a hybrid quantum-classical feature-extraction framework
  for medical image classification. This repository provides executable
  implementations for five MedMNIST subsets, dependency specifications,
  execution instructions, and automatic single-run and five-run
  configurations.
